  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently using SetAvatarEyeHeightByMeters disables Manual Scaling, which is something I've already made a canny about. (https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1312-setavatareyeheightbymeters-disables-manual-scaling)\n\nDue to this I wanted to manually enable it again after having used SetAvatarEyeHeightByMeters, doing so just crashes your game however.\n\n**Repro Steps:**  \n\n- Be in an Avatar with a normal height (between 1-4m)\n\n- Go to my Test world (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f9613ae8-328d-40de-b3b8-bb31332e2bea)  \n\n- Switch to an Avatar taller than 4m  \n\nIf you do this your game will crash. Same thing happens when you join with an Avatar above 4m.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nDoing this should not crash your game.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a link to my script:  \n\nhttps://pastebin.com/JqDp8rQr\n\nHere is a link to my test world:  \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f9613ae8-328d-40de-b3b8-bb31332e2bea",
